although laundry service has been discontinued , towels will continue to be available for your convenience . once the ongoing membership base and associated revenues have been stabilized to support staffing and housekeeping , exercise classes will be scheduled . we anticipate exercise classes to be available within a few weeks . massage therapy services will continue and are available by appointment by calling extension 3 - 3047 .
