6 ge 7 fa turbines for duel fuel operation with dry low - nox combustors . delivery is as follows : 2 - nov . 2002 , 2 - march 2003 , 2 - nov . 2003 .
3 alstom steam turbines for 7 fa application with delivery may , july and oct 2003 .
let me know if anyone has any interest .
thanks ,
