this transaction your share as compensation will be us $ 7 . 3 m ( 25 % ) while my colleagues and i receive
us $ 18 . 98 m ( 65 % ) and the balance of us $ 2 . 92 m ( 10 % ) for taxes and miscellaneous expenses incurred .
this business is completely safe and secure , provided you treat it with utmost confidentiality .
