with system access where appropriate , and especially access to livelink , our
automated contract viewing system . this should facilitate access to all
mexico contracts online ( originals kept in houston ) , and there should be no
need to keep hard copies in mexico .
please let me know if you see any other areas where energy ops can help , or
should be more involved .
beth
