nighthawk systems , inc . provides wireless , remote monitoring and power control equipment and services that save customers time , effort and money .
nighthawk products allow for on - demand processing at single or multiple widespread sites , and are easily installed and operated by anyone , regardless of technical capability .
nighthawk services customers in a variety of markets including electric utilities , traffic control , computer systems , commercial lighting , and irrigation .
nighthawk now numbers among its customers federal and state government facilities , as well as fortune 500 companies and internet service providers .
