now is the time . . . as testimony to the usefulness , quality and uniqueness of our products , these accomplishments have come despite the inability to effectively implement and sustain a marketing campaign . in many cases , customers have literally searched for solutions until they ' ve found our products .
we plan to change our marketing efforts going forward to reach the full market potential of our product line and the applications which it can be utilized . ""
mr . saathoff ( nighthawk ' s chief executive officer ) , "" it is our goal to have our products become ubiquitous in both commercial and consumer applications . as such , i believe the future for the company and its shareholders is bright as we work toward the following sales and marketing objectives in 2005 "" :
- - revenue growth through :
- - hiring sales and marketing personnel . we plan to increase our
sales force with experienced salespeople to effectively target
existing and new markets . those individuals that are specialized in a field will be assigned to those market applications of our products .
- - product marketing including print media and attendance at trade
shows . this method has proved the most effective for our company to date , and we plan to increase our presence in the current
space to attract new customers .
- - an improved internet presence , including an e - commerce website
for retail sales .
- - leveraging existing customer relationships by upselling new
products or fully integrating systems with our company ' s products .
- - the establishment of distribution and dealer networks . through an effective dealer network , we can increase awareness in our products and utilize a dealer ' s sales force to actively promote our products .
- - new applications in irrigation control , civil defense and emergency management . the current product design can be altered with little cost to the company to effectively be implemented into a wide array of fields . through our commitment of funding , we can now research all possible applications and begin to market directly to new customers .
- - the development and launch of a product designed to be used for
multiple purposes by consumers .
in addition to the marketing and sales objectives , we have identified the following strategic goals :
- - joint ventures with wireless service providers and equipment
manufacturers .
- - the identification of complementary products and companies for
potential acquisition .
