lynett and cindy :
greetings from houston !
i have a special request for you . in order for us to prepare our campus
recruiting strategy for next fall , i need information regarding
internship
recruiting .
as you know , we decided to concentrate our spring 2001 effort on intern
recruiting and interviewing . in order for us to ensure that we are
being
effective with this strategy , i need to know which companies interviewed
for summer interns during the fall 2000 recruiting season . companies of
particular interest would be el paso , williams , dynegy , duke , consulting
firms such as mckinsey , and big 5 accounting firms .
by providing this information , you would greatly assist our effort for
upcoming years .
thank you in advance for your assistance .
sincerely ,
lexi elliott
