4922,stock market standouts,"infotex holdings inc ( otc : ifxh )
small emerging growth technology integration firm that helps companies build
and manage network infrastructures ( source : news 4 / 13 / 05 )
current price : $ 1 . 25
please watch this one trade . and watch for more news that may impact the
stock moving forward .
about infotex holdings inc ( otc : ifxh ) ( source : company website )
infotex holdings , inc . ( other otc : ifxh . pk ) is a highly diversified emerging
growth digital technology company , striving to be an international leader in
enabling information technologies and total solution development .
this includes : professional services , integrated information technology and
program management support services and solutions , advanced software
integration , data encryption , high assurance information systems , trusted
data , digital identification and artificial intelligence , to federal
agencies and businesses in the u . s . and around the world .
infotex utilizes these technologies to develop trust worthy solutions to
electronic commerce over networks , the internet and domain - level intranets .
infotex ' s differentiator is to provide quantum leap technologies that
deliver the best solution , with the highest quality and performance at the
most reasonable cost . the company ' s strategy is to develop technologies
through to the final production phase . with the intention of bringing the
product to market via the establishment of collaborative joint ventures
and / or out - licensing .
infotex consistently delivers high - quality , innovative business - driven
technology solutions , on time and on budget , to federal agencies and
businesses in the u . s . and around the world . we are partnered closely with
numerous u . s . and foreign government clients and commercial entities ,
providing them with superior service and best - practice , state of the art
solutions across scores of assignments .
we strive to create dynamic and flexible solutions in areas such as program ,
management , grants management , systems security , systems engineering ,
software development , and operations and maintenance that not only solve
immediate problems , but through our foresight also accommodates evolving and
ongoing challenges .
recent headlines - ( source : recent press releases ) . go to your favorite
financial website and read the full stories . .
1 ) infotex holdings , inc . announced today that it is in negotiations to
purchase medical messenger , inc . medical messenger is an electronic medical
records company specializing in the portability of medical records . the
company has developed an end - to - end electronic records system that places a
mirror image of the patient ' s records on an electronic storage device and at
the remote storage facility in atlanta , ga .
2 ) numericom , inc . completes acquisition of the assets of infotex holdings ,
ltd .
3 ) numericom , inc . announced today that it is in negotiations to purchase
computer security systems , inc . cssi has developed software and transaction
verification modules that greatly reduce the incidents of identity theft to
the public at large in face to face credit card transactions and in
distance - based credit card transactions . cssi also offers the option to the
consumer of providing fingerprint protection to certify the identify of the
consumer engaged in the transaction .
please watch this one trade . these little stocks can surprise in a big way
sometimes . . . .
